# Opens the dev hatch: the two iron levers by the abbey door that reset your
# own day and break your own streak, so the daily rites can be tested more than
# once in twenty-four hours. LEAVE THIS UNSET IN PRODUCTION. With no value the
# /dev/* routes refuse everything and the levers are never drawn — which is the
# point, because a day reset anyone can reach is an unlimited Devotion faucet.
# When it is set, load the game once with ?devkey=<the same value> to hold it.
# DEV_KEY=
